    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Omunabii wa Yuda yamuchesiyia Yeroboamu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne lola, omundu undi waNyasaye yarula eYuda khulwa likhuwa liOMWAMI, niyoola eBeteli; naye Yeroboamu yali nasinjiile hashimalilo okhusamba amalesi kelibuuliesi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omundu oyo nalanjisilia eshimalilo khulwa likhuwa liOMWAMI, nasunga mbu E iwe eshimalilo, eshimalilo, kano niko aka OMWAMI aboola; mbu Lola, omwana aleebulilwa munzu yaDaudi, owa eliiralie mbu Yosia; ne khwiwe nikhwo okhwa aliirila abakuhani abo bahabundu aheechingu abasambilanga amalesi kelibuuliesi khwiwe, abamale babe omusango; balasambila khwiwe amakumba kabandu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana khunyanga eyo nabaheelesia eshilolelo; ari Eshilolelo eshia OMWAMI aboolile shieshino; mbu Lole, eshimalilo shilaatishila hakari, likoshe elilikhwo nilisundukha busundukha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana olwa omuruchi yahulila likhuwa liomundu waNyasaye, elia yalanjisilia eshimalilo eBeteli, Yeroboamu yanyiila omukhono ewa yali hashimalilo, nasunga mbu Mumuhambe. Nomukhonokwe okwa yanyiila okhumufukula kwanyela, nakhaywa okhukukalusia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eshimalilo nashio shiaatishila hakari likoshe nilisundukha busundukha okhurula khushimalilo, eshilolelo eshia omundu waNyasaye yali nahaanile khulwa likhuwa liOMWAMI shinga olwa shiali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana omuruchi nakalusia nasaaya omundu waNyasaye ari Bulaano osabe obukoosia bwOMWAMI Nyasayewo, niusaayila, mbu omukhono kwanje kukalusibwe. Naye omundu waNyasaye nasaba OMWAMI, omukhono kwomuruchi nikukalusibwa, nikuba shinga olwa kubeelenje. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho omuruchi nasunjila omundu waNyasaye mbu Khutsie ninawe ewanje, osakulushe, nasi ndalakhuha amatani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omundu waNyasaye nakalusia omuruchi mbu Ne kata niwakhamba inusu yeinzuyo, shindakheenjila ewuwo ta, kata okhuliakhwo ebiliibwa kata okhunywa amatsi hano tawe; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "okhuba nolwa ndalakwa nelikhuwa liOMWAMI, mbu Oraliakhwo omukaate, kata okhunywa amatsi, kata okhukalushila khunjila tsana eya watsiilakhwo ta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho yeenyoshela khunjila yindi, narakalushila khunjila tsana eya yali niyeetseelekhwo eBeteli ta.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne yaliho omunabii omukofu owali namenyanga eBeteli; ne abaanabe nibeetsa nibamuboolela kosi aka omundu waNyasaye tsana yali niyakholile inyanga eyo muBeteli; nende amakhuwa aka yali namubooleele omuruchi nako baboolela saabwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Saabwe nabareeba mbu Atsiiliile khuli injila shi? Abaanabe nibamumanyia injila eya omundu waNyasaye oyo owarula muYuda yali natsiiliilekhwo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho nasunjila abaanabe ari Mungasilie isishili. Nabo nibamukasilia isishili, naye naniinakhwo, natsia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne yalondakhwo omundu waNyasaye, namunyoola niyeekhaale hamuruba; namureeba mbu Niwe omundu waNyasaye tsana owarula muYuda? Naye ari Nisie. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Namuboolela mbu Chenda khutsie ewanje, oliekhwo ebiliibwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye ari Shinyala okhukalukha ninawe, kata okhwinjila ewuwo ta; kata shinendie ebiliibwa kata okhunywa amatsi hano ninawe ta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okhuba ndaboolelwa nelikhuwa liOMWAMI mbu Oraliakhwo ebiliibwa kata okhunywa amatsi ebweneyo, kata okhushiukhana okhwinyoshela khunjila tsana eya watsiilakhwo ta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye namusunjila mbu Nasi siesi endi omunabii, shingana iwe; ne malaika yambooleele khulwa likhuwa liOMWAMI, mbu Okalushe ewuwo noli ninaye, alie, nanywa amatsi. Ne khane yamubehela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho yakalukha ninaye, nalia ebiliibwa munzuye, nanywa amatsi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne olwa bali nibashiikhaale hameesa, likhuwa liOMWAMI liamwitsila omunabii oyo owamukalusia; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nalanjisilia omundu waNyasaye owarula muYuda ari Kano niko aka OMWAMI aboola; mbu olwa wakhaya likhuwa liOMWAMI, noralinda lilako elia OMWAMI Nyasayewo yakhulaka ta, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "habula okaluushe, nolia, nonywa amatsi habundu tsana aha yakhulakakhwo mbu Oraliakhwo kata okhunywa amatsi ta; kho omulambokwo shikuloola khushilindwa shiabakuukabo ta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne olwa yali naliile nende okhunywa, yamukasilia isishili, omunabii tsana owa yali nakaluushe ninaye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne olwa yali natsiile, italanyi yabukaana ninaye khunjila, niyimwira; omulambokwe nikusukunwa khunjila, isishili niyisinjila ahambi ninakwo, ne italanyi nayo niyisinjila ahambi nomulambo tsana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abandu nibabirayo, nibalola omulambo nikusukuunwe khunjila, nende italanyi niyisinjiile ahambi nomulambo; nibatsia nibakatoonya mwitaala omwa omunabii omukofu tsana yamenya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne olwa omunabii oyo owali namukalusiye okhurula khunjila yahulilakhwo, yasunga mbu Nomundu waNyasaye tsana, owakhaya likhuwa liOMWAMI; niko akachilile OMWAMI namuhaanila italanyi, nayo yimuranduule, niyimwira, likhuwa liOMWAMI shinga olwa libeele elia amubooleele. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho nasunjila abaanabe ari Mungasilie isishili. Nabo nibachikasia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye natsia, nanyoola omulambo tsana, nikusukuunwe khunjila, neisishili nende italanyi nitsisinjiile ahambi nomuiambo. Italanyi shiyali niyiliile omulambo, kata okhurandula isishili ta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omunabii nachinga omulambo kwomundu waNyasaye oyo, nakura khusishili, nakukalusia; niyoola eneetaala, okhumwikhuula nokhumuyabila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niyaalisia omulambokwe mung'ani yiye omwene; nibamwikhuula, bari Woowe, omwana weefwe! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana olwa yali namalile okhumuyabila, yaboolela abaanabe ari Olwa ndiliba nifwile, mulanzabila mushilindwa omwa omundu waNyasaye uno ayabiilwe; nimwalisia amakumba kanje halala namakumbake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okhuba likhuwa elia yalanjisia khulwa likhuwa liOMWAMI, khushimalilo eBeteli, nende khutsinzu tsiosi tsiahabundu aheechingu etsiali mumataala kaSamaria, shililachweya okhuusibwa ta.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
